  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/121">
        <tei:head xml:lang="en">Psalm 121</tei:head>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/1"/>A Song of Ascents.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/2"/>I will lift my eyes to the mountains:
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/3"/>from where will my help come?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/4"/>My help comes from Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/5"/>Maker of heaven and earth.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/6"/>He will not let your foot slip,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/7"/>He will not slumber—your Guardian.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/8"/>Behold, He does not slumber
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/9"/>nor does He sleep—the Guardian of Israel!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/10"/>Adonoy is your Guardian,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/11"/>Adonoy is your shelter at your right hand.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/12"/>By day the sun will not smite you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/13"/>nor the moon at night.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/14"/>Adonoy will guard you from all evil;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/15"/>He will preserve your soul.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/16"/>Adonoy will guard your going and coming,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:psalms/121/17"/>from now and forever.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
